Package: x11-monitor-dimmer
Version: 0.85-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Viridel48
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, python3-xlib, gir1.2-ayatanaappindicator3-0.1, x11-xserver-utils, wmctrl, procps, libx11-6, libxext6
Description: per-display overlay dimmer for Linux X11
 X11 Monitor Dimmer provides independent overlay dimming for connected
 displays, two saved defaults per display, quick-dim presets, custom display
 and default names, tray controls, and EDID-based display identification.
 .
 Originally authored by Viridel48 through v0.85.
